+ * ---- from SSH, once stage 3 is up (test boots only): the audio thread keeps polling GLINK every 20 ms, and
+ *
+ *   kern.sweet_audio_apr   write: struct au_apr_req + payload: one APR command to svc on the DSP, then up to wait_ms
